…","Reversible WPCACHE management and drop-in ownership checks, including exact restoration of existing single-line declarations.","Cloudflare Free setup through one managed Cache Rule, origin-aware TTLs, URL/full purge, encrypted API-secret storage, rule removal on deactivation or cloudflare disconnect, and automatic fallback when a Free zone…","xCloud site discovery, host-cache status, and cache invalidation through its Public API, plus separate detection and 12-hour traffic reporting for xCloud's Cloudflare Enterprise add-on.","Optional origin-pull CDN URL rewriting for an HTTPS hostname or hostname plus path, restricted to selected static-file extensions and same-site source URLs."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wpgaurav/gt-performance/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"30026161274bb5e90d54aac2a6a959c9b2ddb177165b99472355014623725a57","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:35.643Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:35.643Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GT Performance is an independent WordPress performance plugin for safe page caching, server-side frontend optimization, Cloudflare Free orchestration, and commerce-aware cache protection.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wpgaurav/gt-performance/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Optional: Cloudflare proxied DNS and a scoped API token or legacy Global API Key","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wpgaurav/gt-performance/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Calls always require an administrator account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wpgaurav/gt-performance/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"30026161274bb5e90d54aac2a6a959c9b2ddb177165b99472355014623725a57","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wpgaurav/gt-performance/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:35.643Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T04:38:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wpgaur